<title>USA: Wilsons closes private offer.</title>
<headline>Wilsons closes private offer.</headline>
<dateline>BROOKLYN PARK, Minn. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wilsons The Leather Experts Inc said Monday it completed a previously announced private offering of $75 million of 11-1/4 percent senior notes due 2004 to certain institutional buyers.</p>
<p>Wilsons used about $56.5 million of the net proceeds from the offering to repurchase an outstanding senior secured subordinated note. The balance of the net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, including capital expenditures and additional store openings.</p>
<p>Wilsons is a retailer of leather apparel and accessories.</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
